sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor P as Professor
actor A as Aluno
participant WP as SinalizacaoConsumer (professor)
participant WA as SinalizacaoConsumer (aluno)
participant S as Sala em memória
P->>WP: Conecta em ws/sala/{agendamento_id}/
WP->>WP: _autorizar(): papel = professor
WP->>S: sala["professor"] = channel
A->>WA: Conecta em ws/sala/{agendamento_id}/
WA->>WA: _autorizar(): papel = aluno
alt papel já conectado ou sala cheia
  WA-->>A: close(4409 / 4408)
else entrada permitida
  WA->>S: sala["aluno"] = channel
  WA->>WP: peer.joined(role=aluno)
  WA-->>A: peer_joined(role=professor)
end
P->>WP: offer (SDP)
WP->>WA: signal.relay(offer)
WA-->>A: offer
A->>WA: answer (SDP)
WA->>WP: signal.relay(answer)
WP-->>P: answer
loop troca de ICE candidates
  P->>WP: ice-candidate
  WP->>WA: signal.relay
  WA-->>A: ice-candidate
  A->>WA: ice-candidate
  WA->>WP: signal.relay
  WP-->>P: ice-candidate
end
Note over P,A: Conexão P2P WebRTC estabelecida — áudio e vídeo trafegam direto entre os navegadores
A->>WA: Sai da sala (disconnect)
WA->>S: remove sala["aluno"]
WA->>WP: peer.left(role=aluno)
